<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47561" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">taurīnus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj.
		taurus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to bulls</i>
			or <i>oxen</i>, <i>bull</i>'<i>s-</i>, <i>taurine</i> (mostly <b>poet.</b>): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vultus (Eridani),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					G. 4, 371</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">frons,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. F.
					6, 197</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">gluten,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					6, 1069</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sanguis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					28, 9, 41, § 147</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fel,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					28, 9, 40, § 146</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fimum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					28, 17, 68, § 232</span></i>
			: tergum, <i>a bull</i>'<i>s
			hide</i>, <i><span class="en">Verg. A. 1, 368</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">hence, also, tympana (cf. taureus),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Claud. Cons. Stil. 2, 365</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">and pulsus,</span>”
				<i>on a drum</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					Th. 2, 78</span></i>
			.</div>
